    <line x1="522" y1="38" x2="536" y2="38" stroke="var(--viz-rose)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <text x="522" y="56" class="key">frozen</text>
    <text x="522" y="70" class="note">launch map, never refit</text>
    <path class="series" d="M66.0 170.46 L87.14 167.01 L108.29 182.35 L129.43 184.73 L150.57 192.72 L171.71 172.05 L192.86 173.05 L214.0 176.13 L235.14 180.72 L256.29 140.76 L277.43 124.67 L298.57 119.31 L319.71 136.4 L340.86 122.09 L362.0 88.62 L383.14 99.4 L404.29 124.95 L425.43 142.78 L446.57 141.89 L467.71 149.52 L488.86 161.91 L510.0 176.08" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.9" />
    <line x1="522" y1="80" x2="536" y2="80" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <text x="522" y="98" class="key">refit on everything</text>
    <text x="522" y="112" class="note">remembers the calm</text>
    <path class="series" d="M66.0 170.46 L87.14 167.01 L108.29 169.59 L129.43 154.69 L150.57 156.79 L171.71 144.7 L192.86 159.02 L214.0 163.84 L235.14 167.09 L256.29 126.0 L277.43 110.5 L298.57 109.08 L319.71 132.93 L340.86 120.04 L362.0 77.35 L383.14 69.39 L404.29 79.53 L425.43 87.82 L446.57 90.07 L467.71 93.8 L488.86 109.97 L510.0 134.31" stroke="var(--viz-blue)" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.9" />
    <line x1="522" y1="122" x2="536" y2="122" stroke="var(--viz-blue)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <text x="522" y="140" class="key">refit, forget</text>
    <text x="522" y="154" class="note">last 6 batches</text>
  </svg>
  {caption && <figcaption>Same labels, same budget, four memories. A map that never refits drifts away when the storm comes; one that refits on everything it has ever seen is outvoted by the calm; one that forgets follows the storm but stretches one curve over two populations. Forgetting plus one map per keyword family ends 0.8× closer to the truth than the frozen map.</figcaption>}
</figure>

<style>
  .fig { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 1.6rem auto 0.6rem; }
  .fig text { font-family: var(--font-jetbrains); fill: var(--text-dim); }
  .fig .tick { font-size: 11px; }
  .fig .label { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig .mid { text-anchor: middle; }
  .fig .end { text-anchor: end; }
  .fig .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .fig .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .fig .ref { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; fill: none; }
  .fig .series { fill: none; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .fig .key { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .fig .note { font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig .big { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  figcaption {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2.2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
